{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28539","headline":"奉和仆射相公春泽稍愆圣君轸虑嘉雪忽降品汇昭苏即事书成四韵 · 杜牧","name":"奉和仆射相公春泽稍愆圣君轸虑嘉雪忽降品汇昭苏即事书成四韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飘来鸡树凤池边，渐压琼枝冻碧涟。\n银阙双高银汉里，玉山横列玉墀前。\n昭阳殿下风回急，承露盘中月彩圆。\n上相抽毫歌帝德，一篇风雅美丰年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜牧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28539.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28539","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}